<<<
+ raging storm, pestilence, toothache). Raving is an intensifying epithet for madness ora madman. The uses of mad & wild hardly need setting forth. frappant.
===
+ *raging storm, pestilence, toothache*). *Raving* is an intensifying epithet for madness or a madman. The uses of *mad* & *wild* hardly need setting forth.

**frappant.**
